cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this thesis or its accompanying code please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Analysis pipeline for the MSc thesis on ML traffic classification errors and multi-class capacity dimensioning"
abstract: "Analytical and Monte Carlo pipeline that composes a classifier confusion matrix as a linear operator on the per-class offered-load vector and feeds the resulting apparent load into the Kaufman-Roberts recursion for full-availability multirate loss systems. Produces per-class blocking deviation, weighted bandwidth deficit, capacity overhead, constrained sensitivity tensors and minimum-recall thresholds."
